cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use delaycp, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "delaycp: online conformal prediction for streaming classification with delayed, class-imbalanced labels"
abstract: >-
  delaycp wraps any binary classifier that outputs P(fraud) and produces
  approve / review / decline decisions with per-class coverage guarantees
  under delayed labels, class imbalance and drift, using conformal PID
  control with Mondrian thresholds and delay-aware updates.
authors:
  - family-names: Oliveira
    given-names: Adriano
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/adri0/delaycp"
url: "https://adri0.github.io/delaycp/"
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - online learning
  - fraud detection
  - delayed labels
  - class imbalance
  - distribution shift
